  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Redness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A weightless, medium-coverage foundation that blurs and smooths with a natural, hydrated finish, visibly brightens, and reduces the look of wrinkles.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type: </strong>Normal and Combination</p><p><br></p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Suprême Bio-Complex (Proprietary Blend of Oligopeptide-1, Peptide Duo, and Vitamin B3): Jump starts skin renewal, smooths, visibly brightens overall tone, and firms.</p><p>- Biocompatible Pigments and Amino Acid Powders: Meld with skin immediately for payoff that lasts, blur, and absorb excess oil.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Dispense one pump onto the Liquid Foundation Brush (sold separately) or fingertips.<br>-Dab onto the center of the face and blend outward.<br>-Gucci&rsquo;s Tip: &quot;It&rsquo;s very hydrating and blurring but weightless as it glides on, which is incredibly hard to achieve without silicones or microplastics. This formula doesn&rsquo;t feel like a foundation. It feels like you&rsquo;re wearing a favorite serum.&quot;</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Supr&#234;me Bio-Complex (Proprietary Blend of Oligopeptide-1, Peptide Duo, and Vitamin B3): Jump starts skin renewal, smooths, visibly brightens overall tone, and firms.<br>-Biocompatible Pigments and Amino Acid Powders: Meld with skin immediately for payoff that lasts, blur, and absorb excess oil.<br>-Sunflower, Rosemary, and Seaweed Extracts: Antioxidant blend that restores skin barrier, soothes, and smooths skin.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Coconut Alkanes, Triethylhexanoin, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Octyldodecanol, Propanediol, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Lauroyl Lysine, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Oligopeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Sodium Hyaluronate, Chlorella Vulgaris Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Beta-Sitosterol, Niacinamide, Phosphatidylcholine, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Mannitol, Glycerin, Stearalkonium Hectorite, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Sodium Myristoyl Glutamate, Magnesium Sulfate, Propylene Carbonate, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Methylpropanediol, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Potassium Phosphate, Dipotassium Phosphate, Phenylpropanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Tocopherol, Sodium Chloride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Aluminum Hydroxide, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Iron Oxides (CI 77499).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Redness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A weightless, medium-coverage foundation that blurs and smooths with a natural, hydrated finish, visibly brightens, and reduces the look of wrinkles.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type: </strong>Normal and Combination</p><p><br></p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Suprême Bio-Complex (Proprietary Blend of Oligopeptide-1, Peptide Duo, and Vitamin B3): Jump starts skin renewal, smooths, visibly brightens overall tone, and firms.</p><p>- Biocompatible Pigments and Amino Acid Powders: Meld with skin immediately for payoff that lasts, blur, and absorb excess oil.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Dispense one pump onto the Liquid Foundation Brush (sold separately) or fingertips.<br>-Dab onto the center of the face and blend outward.<br>-Gucci&rsquo;s Tip: &quot;It&rsquo;s very hydrating and blurring but weightless as it glides on, which is incredibly hard to achieve without silicones or microplastics. This formula doesn&rsquo;t feel like a foundation. It feels like you&rsquo;re wearing a favorite serum.&quot;</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Supr&#234;me Bio-Complex (Proprietary Blend of Oligopeptide-1, Peptide Duo, and Vitamin B3): Jump starts skin renewal, smooths, visibly brightens overall tone, and firms.<br>-Biocompatible Pigments and Amino Acid Powders: Meld with skin immediately for payoff that lasts, blur, and absorb excess oil.<br>-Sunflower, Rosemary, and Seaweed Extracts: Antioxidant blend that restores skin barrier, soothes, and smooths skin.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Coconut Alkanes, Triethylhexanoin, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Octyldodecanol, Propanediol, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Lauroyl Lysine, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Oligopeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Sodium Hyaluronate, Chlorella Vulgaris Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Beta-Sitosterol, Niacinamide, Phosphatidylcholine, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Mannitol, Glycerin, Stearalkonium Hectorite, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Sodium Myristoyl Glutamate, Magnesium Sulfate, Propylene Carbonate, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Methylpropanediol, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Potassium Phosphate, Dipotassium Phosphate, Phenylpropanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Tocopherol, Sodium Chloride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Aluminum Hydroxide, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Iron Oxides (CI 77499).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
